.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
A pattern matcher for Multiple shell-style glob patterns\&.

Note: this modifies the patterns to work with copy_asset()\&.
      For example, '**/index\&.rst' matches with 'index\&.rst'

.fi
